# Unified-diff patch files must always use LF line endings — CRLF corrupts
# the hunk format and `patch`/`git apply` fail to apply them cleanly. Without
# this, checking out this repo on Windows with `core.autocrlf=true` silently
# mangles every file under vendor/patches/, breaking the vendored
# libghostty-vt/portable-pty patch application regardless of the actual patch
# content — see scripts/test_vendor_libghostty_vt.py and
# scripts/test_vendor_portable_pty.py.
*.patch text eol=lf
